**/__pycache__/*
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
README.html
README_files/
**/data/
# Shipped recon resolver lists are REQUIRED at runtime and asserted by
# test_recon_foundations; un-ignore just this dir's .txt lists so a clean CI
# checkout receives them (the broad `**/data/` rule above must keep generated
# runtime data out — hence the narrow re-include of the `data/` path down to
# the files; git won't descend into an ignored dir, so each level is re-included).
!agent/scripts/assess/data/
!agent/scripts/assess/data/resolvers/
!agent/scripts/assess/data/resolvers/*.txt
**/*.egg-info/
*.sqlite3
*.db
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!agent/.env.example
.runtime-data/
.playwright-mcp/
workspace/
opencode-home/
agent/engagements/*
!agent/engagements/.gitkeep

# Client prompt trees generated by `agent/scripts/render-operator-prompts.sh repo`
# (run by `vigil install` from a checkout and by the release build). Must match
# the renderer's GENERATED_PATHS; hand-authored client files beside them
# (.claude/settings.json, .codex/config.toml, .opencode/plugin/, .zcode/hooks/,
# .zcode/assessment/hooks/) stay tracked. The last entry is the renderer's
# staged-copy prefix, renamed over its destination as each file is written.
/agent/AGENTS.md
/agent/AGENTS-blue.md
/agent/CLAUDE.md
/agent/.claude/agents/
/agent/.claude/commands/
/agent/.codex/agents/
/agent/.codex/skills/
/agent/.goose/
/agent/.opencode/agent/
/agent/.opencode/commands/
/agent/.opencode/assessment/
/agent/.zcode/commands/
/agent/.zcode/.zcode-plugin/
/agent/.zcode/marketplace.json
/agent/.zcode/assessment/agents/
/agent/.zcode/assessment/commands/
/agent/.zcode/assessment/.zcode-plugin/
/agent/.zcode/assessment/marketplace.json
/agent/.vigil-render.*

# Tenant references and engagement analysis are operator-local data. Only
# fictional templates belong in the distributable source tree.
agent/references/tenants/*
!agent/references/tenants/_template-*.md
tools/analysis-state/

CLAUDE-REVIEW.md
CODEX-FINDINGS.md

# Build artifacts (note: `**/*.egg-info/` is already covered above; `**/build/`
# catches build/ at any path including the repo root)
**/build/
prev-issues.md
potentially-updated-issues.md

# Operator-local issue archives and maintainer notes are never distributable.
/.private/

# Local implementation plans; not part of the distributed docs.
docs/plans/
